    {
      "seg_id": 16,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Postoperative nausea and vomiting (PONV) is a common complication after general anesthesia, with incidence of 20-30 %, up to 80% especially in high-risk patient (i.e., female, nonsmoker, opioid analgesia, history of motion sickness or PONV).",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 17,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Palonosetron is a newly developed 5-HT3 antagonist, which possesses more potent and longer acting properties than previously developed 5-HT3 antagonists in patient receiving chemotherapy.However there are little studies for comparison with previously used 5-HT3 antagonists such as ondansetron and ramosetron, especially for prevention of PONV.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 18,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Therefore, we investigated this study to compare the effect of palonosetron on opioid-based IV PCA related PONV in highly susceptible patients undergoing thyroid surgery, with that of ondansetron and ramosetron.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 19,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_중재상세설명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Palonosetron: 0.075 mg intravenous injection 30 minutes ago completion of surgery",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 20,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_군_1.중재군_군명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Group P (Palonosetron group)",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 21,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_군_1.중재군_상세내용",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Palonosetron 0.075 mg in 4 mL was injected and normal saline 8 mL was added to the PCA regimen at the end of the surgery",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 22,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_군_2.중재군_군명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Group O (Ondansetron group)",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 23,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_군_2.중재군_상세내용",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Ondansetron 8 mg in 4 mL was injected and 16 mg in 8 mL was added to the PCA regimen at the end of the surgery",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 24,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_군_3.중재군_군명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Group R (Ramosetron group)",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 25,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_군_3.중재군_상세내용",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Ramosetron 0.3 mg in 4 mL was injected and normal saline 8 mL was added to the PCA regimen at the end of the surgery",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 26,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "9. 대상자선정기준_대상자 포함기준_내용",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Patients undergoing thyroid surgery, with a risk of PONV exceeding 60% are selected according to the expected risk for PONV using the simplified risk score of Apfel et al.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 27,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "9. 대상자선정기준_대상자 포함기준_내용",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "The 4 risk factors considered in this score are female gender, nonsmoking, the use of postoperative opioids, and prior history of motion sickness or PONV; the presence of 0, 1, 2, 3, or 4 of these risk factors correspond to approximately 10, 20, 40, 60, and 80% risk for PONV, respectively.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 28,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "9. 대상자선정기준_대상자 포함기준_내용",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Basic inclusion criteria are nonsmoking, female patients, and use of postoperative opioid.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 29,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "9. 대상자선정기준_대상자 제외기준",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Patients who have severe impairment of bowel motility, insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus, pregnancy or breastfeeding, administration of antiemetic medication within 24 hours before surgery, systemic treatment with steroids within 24 hours before surgery or during 48 hours after surgery, obesity (body mass index >=35 kg/m2),impaired renal and/or hepatic function, or require radical neck dissection",
      "align_score": null
    },
